[*] AoU layout : cocotb multi_outstanding_test - several reads in flight at once.
[*]
[*] Emphasis: BACK-PRESSURE.  The initiator request queue (head/tail/count/full/
[*] empty) is at the top, right under the AR channel that fills it, and the Sec 6
[*] credit counters are expanded because this is the test that drains them.  If
[*] the chain wedges, the answer is nearly always "q_full with every credit at 0"
[*] (the piggyback-return deadlock class) and both halves are on screen together.
[*]
[*] wave-check: env=cocotb
